        "AbstractText": "Reflecting upon my nursing career over the last twenty-five years, comparing the person I was at the start and the person I am now; there is a vast difference. Prior to starting my nursing training I had little experience of the world; I integrated with and was influenced by individuals and my local community and whilst I heard about wider aspects of UK society and the world on television, I had little direct experience. This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved."
